{"Thread-safety issue: `_get_partition_lock` reads/writes `self.partition_locks` without any synchronization. Two threads calling this concurrently for the same `partition` can each create a different lock, leading to operations on that partition being guarded by different locks and races in `all_offsets/outstanding`. Add a global lock around access to `partition_locks`, or precreate locks with a `defaultdict` protected by a mutex.": 0.9709298014640808, "Queues are unbounded (`queue.Queue()` defaults to infinite size). If a downstream item is slow, the queue can grow without limit and exhaust memory under load. Set a maxsize (configurable) and handle `queue.Full` to apply backpressure.": 0.8793233036994934}